.TH WP 1 "@@@DATE@@@" "@@@VERSION@@@" "WordProcess"
.SH NAME
wp \- keyboard-focused console word processor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wp
.RI [ options ]
.RI [ file.wp ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B WordProcess
is a Unicode-aware word processor for structured and long-form writing. A
native .wp file can contain multiple documents and document-specific settings.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show command-line help.
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-version
Show the application version.
.TP
.BI \-\-lua " file"
Run a Lua script and exit.
.TP
.BI \-\-exec " command"
Run a Lua command and exit.
.TP
.BI \-\-convert " source destination"
Convert between supported document formats.
.SH FILES
.TP
.B ~/.wordprocess/startup.lua
Optional per-user startup script.
.SH AUTHORS
WordProcess changes are maintained by Leandro V. Catarin. WordProcess is a
fork of WordGrinder; thanks to David Given for the original work.
